  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-006 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, and Kled. Version 0.8.1 rebuilds Cavalry Knight (cavalry_knight, official 006) as an always-mounted Kled with three independent active slots: Q throws a Bear Trap on a Rope projectile and performs a delayed yank, E is a standalone Jousting dash, and R charges along its selected route. It also fixes Kled's compact portrait and refines the existing map rocks, bushes, and wall surfaces without changing map structure, paths, or collision. Includes ImageGen actor, VFX, icons, Ban/Pick art, and auditable Kled audio. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
